    picks a bag up and carries it.'
  - '71.25cm,40.61cm is the green box centre, measured by fitting its green inner floor
    (19.4x18.4cm) against the calibrated central camera; corner residual RMS 1.59px.'
  - 'The green box (config key ''tray'') and the three blue tissue bags are the only objects
    on the real table; there is no separate tray.'
